      "gloss": "it's possible he'll come",
      "note": "⭐ uncertain plan"
    },
    {
      "word_id": "peut-etre-qu-il-viendra-fr",
      "fr": "peut-être qu'il viendra",
      "gloss": "maybe he'll come",
      "note": "simple maybe"
    },
    {
      "word_id": "il-se-peut-que-fr",
      "fr": "il se peut que",
      "gloss": "it may be that",
